{%- comment -%}
  ADAPTER: Reviews provider swap point.

  Current state (native, no app): sections/product-reviews.liquid reads
  published reviews from product.metafields.custom.reviews (a
  list.metaobject_reference to the `review` metaobject), and the
  submission form emails the merchant via Shopify's native contact form
  for manual moderation/publishing.

  To swap in a real reviews app (e.g. one offering photo/video reviews
  at scale, automated moderation, star-rating widgets on collection
  cards):
    1. Replace the body of sections/product-reviews.liquid with the
       app's Liquid snippet/App Block, or render this file instead and
       have it call the app's snippet.
    2. Update snippets/review-summary.liquid the same way if the app
       also provides its own rating-summary snippet, so the collection
       grid and PDP stay in sync.
    3. Leave the native metaobject fallback in git history - if the app
       is ever removed, reverting this file restores a working,
       app-free reviews module immediately.
{%- endcomment -%}
